---
import SiteFrame from "../layouts/SiteFrame.astro";
---
<SiteFrame title="Comms — SONNY">
  <div class="doc">
    <p class="eyebrow">Comms</p>
    <h1 class="h1">Coming online</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      This channel is reserved for a visual update for our LoRa and ham radio communications networks. We'll be posting maps to all active Meshtastic/Meshcore/Reticulum/Js8call and 'maybe' a new protocol :). Stay tuned and if you'd like to be linked in and / or adopt a Mesh node to enact, please <a href="/contact#tips-form">Send a tip</a>. This is the beating heart of communications that do NOT rely on internet/wifi/grid. When the time comes and we need to connect via voice, text, image or even video you'll realize the value.
      at <a href="/forum">The Table</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</SiteFrame>

<style>
  .doc { max-width: 60ch; margin: 4vh auto 0; }
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.68rem; letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--sage); margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .h1 {
    font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 7vw, 3.8rem); line-height: 1.03;
    margin: 0 0 1.4rem; color: var(--snowmelt);
  }
  .lede { font-family: var(--body); font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--sage); }
  .lede a { color: var(--oxide); text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
